### 获取资产分页列表（带用户信息）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/assets/list?current=1&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 资产领用
# 注意：这里的 assetId 请根据上面 list 接口返回的真实 ID 修改
POST http://localhost:8080/api/assets/claim
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assetId": 1,
  "remark": "初次领用"
}

### 异常测试：重复领用（预期报错）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/assets/claim
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assetId": 1,
  "remark": "再次尝试领用"
}


### 资产退库 (测试权限校验)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/assets/return
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assetId": 1,
  "remark": "设备完好，申请入库"
}

### 新增资产 - 成功示例
POST http://localhost:8080/api/assets/add
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "assetName": "MacBook Pro 16",
  "assetSn": "SN-MBP-2026-001",
  "category": "Electronics",
  "price": 2899.99,
  "location": "Office A-101",
  "purchaseDate": "2026-01-08"
}

### 新增资产 - 失败示例 (触发 @Null 校验，因为带了 ID)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/assets/add
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "assetName": "错误的新增",
  "assetSn": "SN-ERROR-001",
  "price": 100
}

### 更新资产 - 成功示例
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/assets/update
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "id": 1,
  "assetName": "MacBook Pro 16 (已升级内存)",
  "assetSn": "SN-MBP-2026-001",
  "category": "Electronics",
  "price": 3200.00,
  "location": "Office A-101",
  "purchaseDate": "2026-01-08"
}

### 更新资产 - 失败示例 (触发 @NotNull 校验，没带 ID)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/assets/update
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assetName": "没有ID的更新",
  "assetSn": "SN-MBP-2026-001",
  "price": 3200.00
}